From 4e1bad928eb0c276ce49647ea2e9b80bb242cd9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 11:39:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] freeholdos: add the duress decoy user type, routing and
 keyguard hook, and quiesce the real user during a decoy session

freeholdos: add the duress decoy user type, routing and keyguard hook

Squash of former patches:

- 0001 freeholdos: add USER_TYPE_FULL_FREEHOLDOS_DECOY user type
- 0002 freeholdos: accept USER_TYPE_FULL_FREEHOLDOS_DECOY into system-current.txt
- 0003 freeholdos: add dialog-free silent user switch for duress decoy
- 0004 freeholdos: add decoy profile routing state storage
- 0005 freeholdos: add DecoyProfileHelper keyguard hook and freeze/switch orchestration
- 0006 freeholdos: wire decoy routing into doVerifyCredentialInner
- 0007 freeholdos: add set-decoy-profile/clear-decoy-profile shell commands

freeholdos: quiesce the real user during a decoy session and add the return path

Squash of former patches:

- 0008 freeholdos: add RealUserQuiescer for duress decoy freeze/unfreeze
- 0009 freeholdos: expose quiesceUserApps/unquiesceUserApps via ActivityManagerInternal
- 0010 freeholdos: suppress notifications for a duress-quiesced user
- 0011 freeholdos: unquiesce a user automatically when it becomes current
- 0012 freeholdos: quiesce the real user after switching, not before
- 0013 freeholdos: add verifyPrimaryCredentialNoRouting for the duress return path
- 0014 freeholdos: zeroize the synthetic password in verifyPrimaryCredentialNoRouting
- 0015 freeholdos: add ReturnToRealUserHelper, wire the return path
- 0016 freeholdos: suppress call and media notifications for a duress-quiesced user
